---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /blog.html
title: Belvedere – the EISS Blog
description: Belvedere – the EISS Blog, with writing from the EISS network on European security studies by our volunteers and interns.
lang: en
metaImage: /assets/images/blog-meta.jpg
---
{# The blog index (#1259). The launch post promises every post in EN, FR and
   DE, hand-translated (rule §1). The FR/DE pages and chrome are #1740.

   Posts come from the `blog` tag, set for the whole directory in
   src/blog/blog.11tydata.js, so publishing needs no edit to this file. #}
{% from "icons.njk" import icon %}

<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    {#- The Belvedere mark (brand/belvedere-mark.svg). Decorative: the h1 names the page. #}
    <span class="blog-mark" aria-hidden="true">{% inlineSvg "assets/images/brand/belvedere-mark.svg" %}</span>
    <span class="eyebrow">The EISS Blog</span>
    <h1>Belvedere</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">
      Writing from the network on European security studies.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-4);">
      <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" href="/feed.xml">{{ icon("rss") }} Subscribe by feed</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    {%- set posts = collections.blog | reverse %}
    {%- if posts.length %}
    <ul class="blog-list">
      {%- for post in posts %}
      <li class="blog-item">
        <time class="blog-date" datetime="{{ post.date.toISOString().slice(0, 10) }}">
          {{ post.date.toISOString() | newsDate("en") }}
        </time>
        <h2 class="blog-item-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
        <p class="blog-item-byline">
          {{ post.data.author }}{% if post.data.authorNote %}, {{ post.data.authorNote }}{% endif %}
        </p>
        {%- if post.data.summary %}<p class="blog-summary">{{ post.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- else %}
    {#- Live state until the first piece lands. -#}
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 44rem;">
      Nothing published here yet. The first pieces will come from the volunteers joining us this
      autumn.
    </p>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight">
  <div class="container">
    <article class="card" style="padding: clamp(var(--space-6), 2vw + 1rem, var(--space-8));">
      <div class="prose" style="margin-inline: 0;">
        <h2>Writing for us</h2>
        <p>
          Volunteers and interns are offered a piece here as part of their placement. The
          <a href="/internship.html">volunteering page</a> covers how that works.
        </p>
        <p>
          Posts are edited before publication, and we may decline one.
        </p>
        <p>
          Posts appear in English, French and German. We translate by hand, so the French and
          German versions may follow a little after the English.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
